{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 37, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a grand itinerary for thy Japanese sojourn a most regal plan indeed.\n\n**Day One A Tokyo Dawn**\n\nFrom distant shores thou shalt arrive in Tokyo's keep\nA bustling city where ancient secrets sleep.\nTo Shinjuku's heights thy carriage shall ascend\nFor panoramic views that never end.\nA dinner then of ramen rich and deep\nA welcome feast before thy slumbering sleep.\n\n**Day Two Imperial Majesty**\n\nTo Imperial Palace grounds thy footsteps lead\nWhere history's echoes plant a noble seed.\nThen Meiji Jingu Shrine a tranquil place\nTo seek serenity with solemn grace.\nHarajuku's streets a vibrant sight\nWith fashion bold and colours bright.\n\n**Day Three Hakone's Beauty**\n\nHakone's mountains a vision to behold\nWith Lake Ashi's waters shimmering gold.\nA cruise thou'lt take a gentle ride\nPast Mount Fuji's peak in glorious pride.\nArt museums grand a cultural delight\nA day of wonder bathed in soft sunlight.\n\n**Day Four Kyoto's Charm**\n\nBy bullet train to Kyoto thou shalt fly\nA city steeped in tales beneath the sky.\nFushimi Inari's gates a crimson maze\nWhere fox spirits wander through ancient days.\nGion's district a geisha's grace\nA glimpse of beauty in this sacred space.\n\n**Day Five Golden Pavilion**\n\nKinkaku-ji's splendour doth enthrall\nA golden temple answering beauty's call.\nRyoan-ji's garden a meditative art\nWhere stones and raked sand soothe the weary heart.\nNishiki Market's bounty a taste divine\nOf local flavours truly fine.\n\n**Day Six Nara's Deer**\n\nTo Nara's park a journey brief and bold\nWhere friendly deer their stories unfold.\nTodai-ji Temple's Great Buddha grand\nA marvel of art throughout the land.\nKasuga Taisha Shrine with lanterns bright\nA mystical vision in the fading light.\n\n**Day Seven Osaka's Delights**\n\nTo Osaka's fair embrace thy journey goes\nWhere culinary wonders brightly glows.\nDotonbori's lights a vibrant show\nWith street food treats in endless flow.\nOsaka Castle a fortress proud and tall\nA final memory to enthrall.\n\n**Day Eight Farewell Japan**\n\nWith heavy heart thou'lt bid farewell\nTo Japan's beauty a wondrous spell.\nBack to thy homeland thy spirit flies\nWith memories cherished beneath Japanese skies.\nMay fortune smile upon thy days to be\nA traveller blessed eternally.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5393308401107788}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -1.817832589149475}, {"token": "▁itinerary", "logprob": -0.644808828830719}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.014937102794647217}, {"token": "▁thy", "logprob": -0.16540740430355072}, {"token": "▁Japanese", "logprob": -0.45247411727905273}, {"token": "▁so", "logprob": -0.284462571144104}, {"token": "journ", "logprob": -1.1920922133867862e-06}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.27815771102905273}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.5990778803825378}, {"token": "▁regal", "logprob": -1.755051851272583}, {"token": "▁plan", "logprob": -1.4795761108398438}, {"token": "▁indeed", "logprob": -1.029453992843628}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.19356456398963928}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0005098473629914224}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -2.5987286790041253e-05}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.0035710867960006}, {"token": "▁One", "logprob": -0.46357110142707825}, {"token": "▁A", "logprob": -2.2180838584899902}, {"token": "▁Tokyo", "logprob": -0.19150982797145844}, {"token": "▁Dawn", "logprob": -0.31051555275917053}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.0009650102583691478}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0002559096028562635}, {"token": "From", "logprob": -0.009475023485720158}, {"token": "▁distant", "logprob": -0.7338313460350037}, {"token": "▁shores", "logprob": -0.1709214448928833}, {"token": "▁thou", "logprob": -0.4115421772003174}, {"token": "▁shalt", "logprob": -0.029352162033319473}, {"token"